# Wi-Fi 6/6E/7 and Bluetooth firmware, x86_64 only, on top of wireless.list
# (rules/xxri-firmware-wireless.make; the 32-bit system ships wireless.list alone).
#
# Names are what the drivers declare (MODULE_FIRMWARE, scripts/xxri-fw-requested.sh),
# minus what wireless.list has, resolved against linux-firmware 20260810 by
# scripts/xxri-fw-select.py. If a driver wants a newer API than the release
# has, the newest one the release has is named instead.
#
# Scope: Intel AX200/AX201/AX203/AX210/AX211/AX411/BE200 (iwlwifi cc/Qu/QuZ/so/
# ty/ma/gl) and the intel/ibt-* Bluetooth firmware (the driver picks the file
# at run time, so all of the TLV generations are in); MediaTek MT7921/7922/7925
# Wi-Fi and Bluetooth; Realtek RTL8852AE/BE/CE, RTL8851BE, RTL8922AE (rtw89),
# the rtw88 PCIe parts and Bluetooth (btrtl); Qualcomm WCN6855/QCA6390 (ath11k)
# and WCN7850 (ath12k).
# Left out: names the release doesn't have (pre-production iwlwifi bz/sc2,
# ma-a0 steppings).
iwlwifi-cc-a0-77.ucode
iwlwifi-gl-c0-fm-c0-92.ucode
iwlwifi-gl-c0-fm-c0.pnvm
iwlwifi-ma-b0-gf4-a0-89.ucode
iwlwifi-ma-b0-gf4-a0.pnvm
iwlwifi-ma-b0-gf-a0-89.ucode
